ne.\n\nThen finalize the test script.\n\nLet me pre-draft the final answer structure:\n\n```python\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\n\"\"\"Tests for youtube_dl/extractor/linuxacademy.py LinuxAcademyIE._real_extract.\"\"\"\nimport json\n\nfrom youtube_dl.extractor.linuxacademy import LinuxAcademyIE\nfrom youtube_dl.utils import parse_duration, unified_timestamp, urljoin\n\n\ndef _patch_extractor_io(monkeypatch, webpage):\n    calls = {'downloads': [], 'm3u8': [], 'sort_called': []}\n\n    def fake_download_webpage(self, url, video_id, *args, **kwargs):\n        calls['downloads'].append((url, video_id))\n        return webpage\n\n    def fake_extract_m3u8_formats(self, m3u8_url, video_id, ext=None, **kwargs):\n        calls['m3u8'].append({'url': m3u8_url, 'id': video_id, 'ext': ext, 'kwargs': kwargs})\n        return [{\n            'format_id': '%s-fake' % kwargs.get('m3u8_id'),\n            'url': m3u8_url,\n            'ext': ext,\n            'protocol': kwargs.get('entry_protocol'),\n        }]\n\n    def fake_sort_formats(self, formats=None, field_preference=None):\n        calls['sort_called'].append(list(formats or []))\n\n    monkeypatch.setattr(LinuxAcademyIE, '_download_webpage', fake_download_webpage)\n    monkeypatch.setattr(LinuxAcademyIE, '_extract_m3u8_formats', fake_extract_m3u8_formats)\n    monkeypatch.setattr(LinuxAcademyIE, '_sort_formats', fake_sort_formats)\n    return calls\n```\n\nThen the four tests. Let me write them fully.\n\nCourse test \u2014 need URL matching _VALID_URL. Pending get_info.\n\nLet me think about what the real _VALID_URL is, so I can pre-draft. Searching memory of youtube-dl repo... `linuxacademy.py` was added in 2019. The file:\n\n```python\n# coding: utf-8\nfrom __future__ import unicode_literals\n\nimport re\n\nfrom .common import InfoExtractor\nfrom ..compat import compat_str\nfrom ..utils import (\n    clean_html,\n    parse_duration,\n    try_get,\n    unified_timestamp,\n    urljoin,\n)\n\n\nclass LinuxAcademyIE(InfoExtrac